        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_035:79dc71ba",
        "jp_sha256": "d13ee067745803fe491f8f7a0fe7514da8214c0a719a14f0f301f7acbf05397c",
        "official_en_sha256": "ab0580e26430474bbe0b8857e229043864999743d08282cf68740fe453ad07d4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前たち、なかなか良い鍛え方をしているな。\r\nいつか常闇と手合わせしてみるといい。\r\nあいつの剣はすげえぜ。",
        "official_en": "I suggest you have a round or two with Umbra sometime. His own blade packs quite a punch.",
        "real_en": "You've trained well. You should spar with Veritas of the Dark someday. His sword is something else."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
