    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_041:ad35f707",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_041",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_041:ad35f707",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_041:ad35f707",
        "jp_sha256": "d22a8665c05cd59b0cea251a2a59016d3b9ac2afdc96a6786d26b772cebc022e",
        "official_en_sha256": "71ac7fa137418e756c6c6bcd428d201267fc9abb7fa995b8d0cdcaead01c5e9e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、この戦争で魔人フィーナと\r\n決着をつけるしかないのだ。\r\n邪魔してくれるなよ。",
        "official_en": "Which is why I intend to fight her in this war instead. I must warn you not to stand in my way.",
        "real_en": "That's why I have no choice but to settle things with Dark Fina in this war. Don't get in my way."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "game_text_unclassified",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": null,
        "sequence": null,
