        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_006:0c1b4441",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_006:0c1b4441",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_006:0c1b4441",
        "jp_sha256": "5f661f9c32cdcba583f8528aa0c31a3032715d29be448498d010ad2d487c2843",
        "official_en_sha256": "31cc16bb2435c6df671361aacbeecca15308460b336ed69e417dea88675c5d3a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "とはいえ、戦いの中で高潔であり続けるのは\r\nとても難しいことだ。\r\n高潔さは翻れば、邪悪に繋がるものだからな……。",
        "official_en": "Yet, I cannot begin to imagine the resolve required to uphold virtue in the midst of war...for virtue and malice are, after all, two faces of the same coin.",
        "real_en": "But it's terribly difficult to remain noble in the midst of battle. Even nobility can turn to wickedness..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
