    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_015:edc95251",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45",
        "key": "FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_015",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_015:edc95251",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_FEV_Dng_07Mys_45:FEV_Dng_07Mys_45_015:edc95251",
        "jp_sha256": "2f02286554f3b5067b7ccdbf1ae43ecbf757d3543a9b16b0c55b5fe1c515856c",
        "official_en_sha256": "f75c0a31384aed02eb90df4c08d4d5b93d215556166bc16d62628595a9b35792"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "アルドールとの戦力差など、\r\nベヒーモス様がいれば\r\n簡単にひっくり返せるだろう。",
        "official_en": "We may be outnumbered by the Aldorians, but Lord Behemoth’s might can easily tip the scales in our favor.",
        "real_en": "The difference in strength with Aldore\r\nwould be easy to overcome\r\nwith Behemoth-sama on our side."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
