      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "私の姉さんは光輝のヴェリアスなんだけど、\r\n心配症でね。お前は未熟だって\r\n私を難しい任務から外そうとするの。",
        "official_en": "Lux is my sister, but she says I’m too green and the responsibility’s too much for me to handle. Can you believe she tries to cut me out of the more difficult missions?",
        "real_en": "My older sister is Radiance Veritas, but she's such a worrier. She says I'm still inexperienced and tries to keep me off difficult missions."
